q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (blind.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 741.91 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg ("My mother put it there?" he said. "Nobody has touched this portrait in twenty years.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 712.43 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg ("My mother put it there," Elena said quietly. "She was your mother's maid. For thirty years.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 682.95 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Adrian read the first line, and the room went silent around him.) Tj ET Q
