q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.313 Tw (The letter said Carlo had known about the secret marriage within a week. It said he had paid) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.754 Tw (Elena's family to leave the city, and when they refused, he had threatened them. A child of the) Tj ET Q
